==Trivia==
===Etymology===
* A ''[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zanni Zani]'' (more commonly spelled ''Zanni'') was a character performed during Italian comedy, typically appearing as an immigrant working as a servant. Typically, a Zani was a shrewd, successful trickster.